olds wages down I've talked  about this before the corporation's who  are hiring undocumented immigrants are  to blame for any  impact on wages which by all accounts is  extraordinarily modest but the real  problem is that the corporations aren't  being punished for hiring undocumented  immigrants and the undocumented  immigrants are being scapegoated there  i've already widely talked about that i  won't spend a lot of time on it today  but Donald Trump's proposal and offered  to Democrats is what I want to focus in  on Donald Trump wants to begin with  number one 800 million dollars in  humanitarian aid number two 805 million  dollars in drug detection 2,750  additional border agents and law  enforcement new hires 75 judge teams for  immigration courts and of course 5.7  billion dollars for what he is now  calling a steel barrier along 230 miles  of border amazingly during this speech  Donald Trump actually said you know we  don't really need a border wall across  the entire border because there are some  natural barriers like bodies of water  which of course is exactly what we've  been saying for years at this point  Trump isn't actually realizing that he  doesn't want that full border wall he is  realizing that he's just not gonna get a  win on the entire border wall so now  he's pretending he never really wanted  the whole border wall anyway absolutely  unbelievable that the goal posts are  being moved in this way now what is  Donald Trump willing to offer Democrats  if they give him the 5.7 billion in  order to get government reopened Trump  is willing to give number-one an asylum  application process that would take  place in countries of origin okay this  is a big deal because there's this  discussion over  people are coming in these caravans to  the border and and they're coming over  illegally except no they're not they're  actually going to the border to request  asylum because there's no process for  doing that in their country of origin  Donald Trump is 